<p class="pk-text" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Rubik', 'Rubik Fallback', ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#262d40">To use Mossgarden on it again, sign in to Mossgarden on that device.</p>
