<tr><td align="center" style="padding:32px 16px">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:100%;max-width:520px">
<tr><td class="pk-card" bgcolor="#ffffff" style="padding:32px;background-color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dadee9;border-radius:10px">
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:0 0 20px"><tr><td><h1 class="pk-strong" style="margin:0;font-family:'Rubik', 'Rubik Fallback', ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:24px;line-height:32px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:#060912">Mossgarden</h1></td></tr></table>
<p class="pk-text" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Rubik', 'Rubik Fallback', ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#262d40">Hi Ada,</p>
<p class="pk-text" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Rubik', 'Rubik Fallback', ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#262d40">Here is your license key.</p>
