<body class="pk-bg" style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#f6f8ff">
<table role="presentation" class="pk-bg" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#f6f8ff" style="width:100%;background-color:#f6f8ff">
<tr><td align="center" style="padding:32px 16px">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:100%;max-width:520px">
<tr><td align="center" style="padding:0 0 0px;text-align:center"><img class="pk-logo-light" src="https://key.plrs.im/assets/branding/locker/locker-horizontal-light-640.png" width="230" height="64" alt="Polaris Locker" style="display:block;margin:0 auto;width:230px;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none"><!--[if !mso]><!--><img class="pk-logo-dark" src="https://key.plrs.im/assets/branding/locker/locker-horizontal-dark-640.png" width="230" height="64" alt="Polaris Locker" style="display:none;margin:0 auto;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all;width:230px;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none"><!--<![endif]--></td></tr>
<tr><td class="pk-card" bgcolor="#ffffff" style="padding:32px;background-color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dadee9;border-radius:10px">
<h1 class="pk-strong" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Rubik', 'Rubik Fallback', ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:24px;line-height:32px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:#060912">Your license has a new key</h1>
<p class="pk-text" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Rubik', 'Rubik Fallback', ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#262d40">A new license key for Mossgarden was made in your Polaris Locker account.</p>
<p class="pk-text" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Rubik', 'Rubik Fallback', ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#262d40">The old key no longer activates new devices; devices already using the product keep working.</p>
<p class="pk-text" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Rubik', 'Rubik Fallback', ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#262d40">If this wasn&#x27;t you, sign in and get a new key again, then contact the developer.</p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:8px 0 24px"><tr><td class="pk-btn" bgcolor="#060912" style="border-radius:6px;background-color:#060912"><a class="pk-btn-a" href="https://key.plrs.im/#/p/mossgarden" style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 24px;font-family:'Rubik', 'Rubik Fallback', ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:20px;font-weight:700;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:6px">Open Mossgarden</a></td></tr></table><p class="pk-muted" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Rubik', 'Rubik Fallback', ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#48536b">If the button does not work, paste this link into your browser:</p><p style="margin:0;font-family:'JetBrains Mono', 'JetBrains Mono Fallback', ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, 'SF Mono', Menlo, Consolas, 'Liberation Mono', monospace;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;word-break:break-all"><a class="pk-link" href="https://key.plrs.im/#/p/mossgarden" style="color:#060912;text-decoration:underline">https://key.plrs.im/#/p/mossgarden</a></p>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:24px 0 16px"><tr><td class="pk-callout" bgcolor="#f6f8ff" style="padding:12px 16px;background-color:#f6f8ff;border:1px solid #dadee9;border-radius:6px;font-family:'Rubik', 'Rubik Fallback', ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;color:#262d40"><span class="pk-text"><strong>Wasn&#x27;t you?</strong> <a class="pk-link" href="https://key.plrs.im/#/account/methods" style="color:#060912;text-decoration:underline">Secure your account</a></span></td></tr></table>
</td></tr>
<tr><td class="pk-muted" style="padding:24px 8px 0;font-family:'Rubik', 'Rubik Fallback', ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#48536b">You are receiving this because of a change to your Polaris Locker account. We sent it to every verified email on the account.</td></tr>
</table>
</td></tr>
</table>
</body>
</html>",
  "license-link-superseded": "<!doctype html>
