<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:100%;max-width:520px">
<tr><td align="center" style="padding:0 0 0px;text-align:center"><img class="pk-logo-light" src="https://key.plrs.im/assets/branding/locker/locker-horizontal-light-640.png" width="230" height="64" alt="Polaris Locker" style="display:block;margin:0 auto;width:230px;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none"><!--[if !mso]><!--><img class="pk-logo-dark" src="https://key.plrs.im/assets/branding/locker/locker-horizontal-dark-640.png" width="230" height="64" alt="Polaris Locker" style="display:none;margin:0 auto;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all;width:230px;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none"><!--<![endif]--></td></tr>
<tr><td class="pk-card" bgcolor="#ffffff" style="padding:32px;background-color:#ffffff;border:1px solid #dadee9;border-radius:10px">
<h1 class="pk-strong" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Rubik', 'Rubik Fallback', ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:24px;line-height:32px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.01em;color:#060912">The developer removed a Mossgarden license from your account</h1>
<p class="pk-text" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Rubik', 'Rubik Fallback', ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#262d40">The developer of Mossgarden removed one of its licenses from your Polaris Locker account, at the request of its support. It is no longer in your library.</p>
<p class="pk-text" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Rubik', 'Rubik Fallback', ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#262d40">If you did not expect this, contact the developer&#x27;s support now: they can undo it for 72 hours.</p>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:24px 0 16px"><tr><td class="pk-callout" bgcolor="#f6f8ff" style="padding:12px 16px;background-color:#f6f8ff;border:1px solid #dadee9;border-radius:6px;font-family:'Rubik', 'Rubik Fallback', ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;color:#262d40"><span class="pk-text"><strong>Wasn&#x27;t you?</strong> <a class="pk-link" href="https://key.plrs.im/#/account/methods" style="color:#060912;text-decoration:underline">Secure your account</a></span></td></tr></table>
</td></tr>
<tr><td class="pk-muted" style="padding:24px 8px 0;font-family:'Rubik', 'Rubik Fallback', ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#48536b">You are receiving this because of a change to your Polaris Locker account. We sent it to every verified email on the account.</td></tr>
</table>
</td></tr>
</table>
