<p class="pk-text" style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Rubik', 'Rubik Fallback', ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;color:#262d40">Use the button below to sign in. The link expires in 10 minutes and works once.</p>
